@itstartstosnow/dsh-context-window-reminder README · 已知限制：- 数字是宿主估算（与界面占用环同源），不是 provider 账单级精确值，判断"还剩多少"足够。
- 不含本轮刚发出、尚未写入会话的那条消息本身，所以可能比最终请求略小一点。
- 只影响模型可见的上下文，不改变界面仪表、压缩策略或任何工具行为。

@itstartstosnow/dsh-context-window-reminder README · dsh-context-window-reminder：❌ Context only; it does not involve billing, plan, account usage, or any usage data.

It is deliberately minimal: **one data line per injection, with no judgment, advice, thresholds, or status tiers**. How to use that number — whether to rein in, keep going, or plan differently — is left to the model itself.

Works on DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 0.2.1-rc.x. Host-only plugin; once installed it applies to every session.

@itstartstosnow/dsh-context-window-reminder README · Known limitations：- The numbers are host estimates (same source as the composer ring), not billing-grade; that is enough for "how much room is left".
- The message you just sent in the current turn is not included (it is not written to the session when the number is taken), so the real request may be slightly larger.
- Only the model-visible context changes; the UI meter, compaction, and tool behavior are untouched.
